// BOLT-11 Lightning invoices: the specification's own examples decoded, each valid one with its
// amount, tags and payee, and each invalid one refused for its reason. Nothing is paid, and no
// node is asked: the signature alone says who wrote the invoice.
//
//   quillo run lightning_invoice.qwe
//   then open http://localhost:8080/decode?invoice=lnbc..., /coffee, /tags, /signature, /expiry and /refused

use "lightning_invoice.qwer"

// From BOLT #11, "Examples" and "Examples of Invalid Invoices".
